@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title BC-01 Tenant & Access Governance — C4 L3 TARGET
legend bottom
  Component view inside the shared Nexa API modular monolith.
  It is not an independent container, deployment unit, database or Bounded Context.
endlegend
package "Nexa API — logical BC-01 ownership" {
  component "Access Governance API\n<<Interface>>" as api
  component "SubmitCompanyOnboardingHandler\nActivateTenantHandler\nEvaluateAccessHandler\n<<Application>>" as app
  component "Tenant, Workspace, Membership & Capability\n<<Domain>>" as domain
  component "Access Context, Repositories & RLS Adapter\n<<Infrastructure>>" as infra
  database "Shared PostgreSQL\nBC-01 logical tables" as db
  component "Transactional Outbox\n<<Reliability>>" as outbox
}
component "Tenant-scoped BC contracts\n<<explicit consumers>>" as consumers
api --> app : commands / queries
app --> domain : authorize and decide
domain --> infra : persistence ports
infra --> db : tenant predicates
app --> outbox : committed facts
outbox --> consumers : at-least-once facts
note bottom of domain
Tenant != Workspace; Human Identity != Workforce Membership.
Missing scope fails closed.
end note
@enduml
